# PLACEHOLDER — the Redstone Vaporizer, and the greyscale mask of its load.
#
# Two files, and they must line up: packed_vaporizer_load.png is drawn on layer1 over
# vaporizer.png on layer0, and the strain's colour tints layer1 alone. So every lit pixel in
# the mask has to fall inside the oven window cut into the body below it — see
# ModItemProperties.LOAD_TINT_INDEX and ModModelProvider's packed-device branch.
#
# Palette is sampled, not invented: iron from vanilla's iron_ingot, redstone from vanilla's
# redstone dust, and the base from this mod's own hemp_planks so the wood matches the pipe.
#
# Identity: what makes this a vaporizer and not a box is the mouthpiece nub on top and the
# lit oven window in the belly. Everything else is the body those two hang off.

@palette default
. = none
o = 121212
k = 252525
d = 353535
m = 585858
g = 727272
l = 8F8F8F
h = A8A8A8
w = D8D8D8
r = 5C0700
R = AA0F01
F = FF0000
b = 2D0000
1 = B0B0B0
2 = BCBCBC
3 = D4D4D4
4 = FFFFFF
p = 5A5236
q = 82794E
s = A1976C

@texture item/vaporizer 16x16 type=item
................
......owwo......
......ohho......
....oodddgoo....
...odmmmmmglo...
..odmgggggmlho..
..okmgbbbbgmlo..
..okmgbFFbgmlo..
..okmgbRRbgmlo..
..okmgbbbbgmlo..
..okmgggggmllo..
..okmgggggmllo..
..okdmmmmmglo...
..oopqqqqqspo...
...opqqqqqspo...
....oopppoo.....

# The load: only the oven window, and only where the body left a hole for it. Greyscale,
# because this layer is what the strain's colour multiplies — white reads as "full strength
# of whatever is packed", and anything already coloured would fight the tint. Same four greys
# as packed_pipe_load, top-lit, so a packed chamber has some depth once the tint lands on it
# instead of reading as a flat swatch.
#
# Empty, the window shows the element glowing red; packed, it shows what is in it. That is the
# whole packed/unpacked tell, and it costs a four-pixel-wide hole in the body.
@texture item/packed_vaporizer_load 16x16 type=item
................
................
................
................
................
................
.......44.......
.......34.......
.......23.......
.......12.......
................
................
................
................
